# Key material. Nothing in this repository needs any: the four services run as
# one venue on one host and their gRPC channels are plaintext on 127.0.0.1
# (see spotapi/grpc/server.js). 54 cert/key files under two other companies'
# hostnames - 21 of them PEM private keys - were removed from the tree; these
# rules stop a replacement being committed by accident. If this venue is ever
# split across hosts and needs real credentials, generate them at deploy time
# and keep them out of git.
*.key
*.pem
*.crt
*.csr
*.p12
*.pfx
private/

# Local runtime artefacts. `mongodb-data*/` and `dump.rdb` were already ignored;
# the mongo log was not, so a `git add -A` would have committed 10 MB of query
# log alongside the database it describes.
mongodb.log
mongodb.log.*

# Playwright output. A 566 KB HTML report and a run-status file were tracked,
# left over from an earlier session and matched by no rule.
playwright-report/
test-results/

# Agent/editor local state
.claude/
.vscode/
.idea/
